egal right to enter facilities and review records (with resident consent); (4) **Free service** to residents and families; (5) **Referral authority**: can refer cases to the State Survey Agency for regulatory action or to Adult Protective Services; (6) **Regular facility visits**: provide monitoring and early problem detection. The LTCO is distinct from APS (which handles community-based abuse) and the State Survey Agency (which conducts formal inspections). (Ref: Hazzard''s Ch. 17; AGS Geriatrics At Your Fingertips; Current Diagnosis & Treatment: Geriatrics)'),
